{"title": "Redvein Savagery", "pageid": 28115, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Redvein_Savagery", "categories": ["Damage Rider As Source", "Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Redvein Savagery</b> is a passive feature that deals more damage to targets.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you make an attack with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>, the target takes an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">7</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a><abbr title=\"Damage Rider As Source\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">DRS</a></abbr> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Mischief\" title=\"Crimson Mischief\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png/30px-Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png/45px-Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png/60px-Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png/30px-Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Mischief\" title=\"Crimson Mischief\">Crimson Mischief</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Redvein Savagery does not give +7 damage to offhand or ranged attacks made with Advantage. However, it <i>does</i> give +7 damage to any Sneak Attack bonuses that trigger from main hand melee attacks, for a total of +14 damage to such attacks.</li>\n<li>Although the tooltip does not specify, Redvein Savagery only applies to attacks which involve this weapon.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714221918\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1300/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11679/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4333/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 817866/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.624      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   37.624      1 -total\n 35.00%   13.168      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 27.54%   10.362      2 Template:Icon_link\n 26.51%    9.973      2 Template:Icon_text\n 25.75%    9.688     15 Template:Trim\n 23.36%    8.788      1 Template:Advantage\n 22.74%    8.554      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 20.56%    7.737      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 20.12%    7.571      4 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28115-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714221918 and revision id 371559. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}